	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『ガンダムビルドファイターズ バトローグ』第4話に登場する新機体「ストライカージンクス」がHGBFで立体化！",
			"• フルアーマーを思わせる重厚な追加装甲に加え、ディフェンスロッドなどの装甲パーツ、頭部は新規造形で再現！さらに、カスタマイズされた装甲はパージして軽装状態を再現可能！",
			"• 付属する新設定の大型ライフルは、各所のグリップにより両手で保持が出来る構造になっており、ダイナミックな射撃ポーズが可能！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• The new aircraft \"Striker Jinx\" appearing in the 4th episode of \"Gundam Build Fighters Battlogue\" is now three-dimensional with HGBF!",
			"• In addition to heavy additional armor reminiscent of full armor, armored parts such as defense rods and the head are reproduced with new modeling! Furthermore, customized armor can be purged to recreate a lightly armored state!",
			"• The newly designed large rifle that comes with it has a structure that allows it to be held with both hands with grips in various places, allowing for dynamic shooting poses!"
		]
	},
